  <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-info">
    <strong>🧠 Resilient AI Gateway Architecture:</strong><br />
    The Agent Station routes all AI queries through a local <code>litellm-proxy</code> container on port <code>4000</code>. If an upstream provider suffers rate limiting (HTTP 429) or server outages (HTTP 500/503), the gateway seamlessly cascades to the next healthy model in milliseconds with zero dropped messages.
  </div>

